# The GraphQL contract schema is machine-published (the graphql-contract
# distribution branch) and staged at this exact path by CI before Gradle
# runs (see android/app/build.gradle.kts — apollo schemaFiles.from). It is
# never committed: hand-copied SDL is the Phase-5 anti-pattern
# (docs/api/graphql-target-architecture.md §11-Phase-5 acceptance:
# "no hand-copied SDL between repositories").
app/src/main/graphql/schema.graphqls
# Kotlin 2.4 build session directory (gradle runs leave it next to the build
# output; it is machine-local state, never source).
.kotlin/
